:bo133-2-225906"><span class="ln-ico ln-info"></span></a></div></li></ul></div><div class="titleInfo titleAdd columns " id="titleInfoRestrictioninfo"><div class="subheader" role="heading">Restriction-Information</div><ul class="nav"><li><span class="infoFly  licenseInfo allowed-true"><span class="licenseInfo-indicator licenseInfo-indicator-allowed-true licenseInfo-indicator-vlreader-true">&#160;</span><span class="licenseInfo-accessmsg">The document is publicly available on the WWW</span></span></li></ul></div><div class="titleInfo titleAdd columns " id="titleInfoLinkActions"><div class="subheader" role="heading">Links</div><ul class="nav"><li class="cols"><div class="name titleinfoLinkAction">Reference</div><div id="titleinfoLinksOpac" class="value titleinfoLinkAction"><div class="opacLink" style="padding-bottom:0"><span class="ln-ico ln-info"></span><span class="hide-underlined">&#160;</span><a href="https://library.fes.de/TouchPoint/start.do?Query=10=%22BV050356999%22" target="_blank" class="external"><span>Bibliothekskatalog der Friedrich-Ebert-Stiftung</span></a></div></div></li><li class="cols"><div class="name titleinfoLinkAction">Archive</div><div id="titleinfoLinksArchive" class="value titleinfoLinkAction"><span class="ln-ico ln-oai"></span><span class="hide-underlined">&#160;</span><a id="archiveOAI" title="OAI-Source" target="_blank" href="/publikationen/oai/?verb=GetRecord&amp;metadataPrefix=mets&amp;identifier=1885989"><span>METS (OAI-PMH)</span></a></div></li></ul></div><div class="titleInfo titleAdd columns " id="titleinfoResources"><div class="subheader" role="heading">Files</div><ul class="nav"><li><div class="content classic" style=""><div><div class="resource block"><span class="ln-ico ln-pdf"></span><span class="hide-underlined">&#160;</span><a class="reslink downloadPdf" href="/publikationen/download/pdf/1885989" target=""><span class="caption full">Die Zukunft der NATO</span><span class="ext"> [<span class="filesize">538.59 kb</span>]</span></a></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class="titleInfo titleAdd columns " id="titleInfoClassification"><div class="subheader" role="heading">Classification</div><ul class="nav"><li><div class="titleInfoClassification"><div class="classificationLinks linkedAncestorStructureAxis fesps"><nav role="navigation"><a class="item pos1 fesps" href="/publikationen/topic/titles/1318547">Organisationseinheiten</a> <span class="next pos2"></span><a class="item pos2 fesps" href="/publikationen/topic/titles/1318577">Internationale Zusammenarbeit (IZ)</a> </nav></div><div class="classificationLinks linkedAncestorStructureAxis fesps"><nav role="navigation"><a class="item pos1 fesps" href="/publikationen/topic/titles/1318547">Organisationseinheiten</a> <span class="next pos2"></span><a class="item pos2 fesps" href="/publikationen/topic/titles/1318577">Internationale Zusammenarbeit (IZ)</a> <span class="next pos3"></span><a class="item pos3 fesps" href="/publikationen/topic/titles/1318681">Globale und Europ&#228;ische Politik (GEP)</a> <span class="next pos4"></span><a class="item pos4 fesps" href="/publikationen/topic/titles/1318682">Referat GEP (Berlin)</a> </nav></div></div></li></ul></div><div class="titleInfo titleAdd columns " id="titleInfoWikiAbstract"><div class="subheader" role="heading">Abstract</div><ul class="nav"><li>Frankreich setzt im sicherheitspolitischen Wandel auf europ&#228;ische Handlungsf&#228;higkeit statt Abh&#228;ngigkeit von den USA. Die Studie zeigt die neue Rolle an der Ostflanke, die St&#228;rkung der nuklearen Abschreckung und den Ruf nach einer echten europ&#228;ischen Verteidigung &#8211; zwischen nationalem Anspruch, europ&#228;ischer Verantwortung und transatlantischer Realit&#228;t. Diese Publikation ist Teil der Studie &#8222;Die Zukunft der NATO&#8220;. Mehr auf: www.fes.de/zukunft-der-nato</li></ul></div></div></div></div><var id="publicationID" value="1885989" class="zoomfullScreen"> </var><var id="mdlistCols" value="false"> </var><var id="isFullzoom" value="false" class="zoomfullScreen"> </var><var id="employsPageview" value="false" class="pagetabs"> </var><var id="webcacheSizes" value="128,304,504,800,1000,1200,1504,2000"> </var><var id="navLastSearchUrl" value=""> </var></main></div><div id="bottomParts" class=""><footer role="contentinfo" class=""><div id="custom-footer" class="wiki wiki-bottom custom-footer wiki-custom-footer customFooter "><div class="top">
